@ApiGateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Gateway Health
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### Route to InventoryService - Get Products
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Route to InventoryService - Get Inventory
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/inventory
Accept: application/json

### Route to SupplierService - Get Suppliers
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/suppliers
Accept: application/json

### Route to ProcurementService - Get Purchase Orders
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders
Accept: application/json
